Self-test of farm/rtl34/verify_zipdiv.py, run before any LLM rewrite of zipdiv existed (2026-10-29T10:00:22Z; supersedes the 07:26Z self-test).
gate sha256 fbcf4490223efc437fec1a997b3796419ed4b04d42a7289399ffea1795413569 (every control below was run with this exact file; each control log prints it)
orig sha256 58775b1ff9abf5d66876f65072a5d5d0199de3832d7850b6926fc35ac1bb6f61 (designs/zipdiv/src/zipdiv.v)
Changes since 07:26Z, from an independent static review of the gate source: a bounded-formal counterexample now fails
the gate (it proves the outputs differ for some input sequence; a formal run that finds none is still reported only);
fewer than 200,000 lockstep cycles is refused; initial values are rejected in any form (an `initial` keyword anywhere
outside comments, a `reg` declared with a value, or any signal Yosys marks with an init attribute).
Positive control: the original with its `initial` lines removed (every register is reset synchronously). Negative
controls: five one-line logic mutants, two initial-value forms, and a rare-case mutant that random simulation cannot
reach but formal can; each must FAIL. Each control's sha256 is listed.

== positive control noinit.v (sha256 2d3b1410907a3b3cb160bda6a6a812e263849a07d4546bf283836a787014affe), 250,000 cycles + bounded formal (240 s budget)
  (0) PASS: Verilog-2005, elaborates, same ports ['i_clk', 'i_denominator', 'i_numerator', 'i_reset', 'i_signed', 'i_wr', 'o_busy', 'o_err', 'o_flags', 'o_quotient', 'o_valid'] and parameters {'BW': 32, 'LGBW': 5}
  (a) LOCKSTEP PASS: 250000 cycles compared (outputs after every edge and every input change), 805 resets, 29857 requests (22993 while busy), 37084 o_valid pulses, 1512 o_err cycles (orig)
  REFERENCE PASS: 4750 clean divisions matched the C reference in both modules (1576 signed with a negative operand, 581 zero divisors, 478 with -2^31 or -1 operands)  [0 s]
  (c) no counterexample in frames 0..11 (cycles after reset); stopped after 240 s
  VERDICT: PASS {"interface": true, "lockstep": true, "formal": "no counterexample in frames 0..11 (cycles after reset); stopped after 240 s"}  (270 s)
